en:
[Emergency Rewind:]<bold> Gather [{0} Shards]<shard> after each combat victory while [Emergency Rewind]<bold> is available. If you are defeated in combat, [Emergency Rewind]<bold> will activate to protect your run and release all of its gathered [Shards]<shard>. If you are defeated in combat while [Emergency Rewind]<bold> is unavailable, your run will end in defeat.

[Emergency Rewind]<bold> is available.
